      "content": "but it's not just about taking a break... it's like, the weight of it is everywhere. even when i'm alone i'm still fighting my own brain. it feels like there's no version of life where i can actually just exist without it being a constant battle. it's just so heavy. it feels like there's no actual way out of the struggle.",
